<title>GREECE: INSTITUTIONAL INVESTORS ASK LISTINGS FOR UPDATE.</title>
<headline>INSTITUTIONAL INVESTORS ASK LISTINGS FOR UPDATE.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The union of Greece's Institutional Investors asked listed companies on the Athens stock exchange to take part in a presentation programme and update the union's members on current company activities, it said in a statement. --George Georgiopoulos, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
